# Shared headers

PlatformIO's optional project-wide include directory. The current firmware keeps
configuration headers in ../config/ and component headers beside their sources
in ../src/. Both directories are added to the compiler include path by
../platformio.ini. Put a header here only when it needs project-wide visibility.

Do not put Wi-Fi or OTA credentials here. Private defaults belong in the ignored
../config/network_secrets.h, copied from network_secrets.example.h on a new PC.

Source map: ../../CLAUDE.md
Build from the repository root: docker\mor_luam.bat fw-build
